{"hw":"πονηρία","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πονηρία</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πονηρ-ία</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">bad state</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">condition,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ὀφθαλμῶν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hp.Mi.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">374d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡ τοῦ σώματος π.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">609c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. ψυχῆς</span> ibid. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> in moral sense, <b class=\"lex-tr\">wickedness, vice, knavery,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἡ μωρία.. ἀδελφὴ τῆς π. ἔφυ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">925</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Th.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">868</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22.16</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">εἰς τὴν π. πάλιν τρέπεται</span> turns again to <b class=\"lex-tr\">vice,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.5.75</span> </span>: in pl., <b class=\"lex-tr\">knavish tricks, rogueries,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">21.19</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1389a18</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">baseness, cowardice,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">645</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.9</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> with a political connotation, <b class=\"lex-tr\">mob-rule,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.47</span> </span>.</div></div>"}